1
00:00:00,457 --> 00:00:03,127
...like they do at Camp Hess Kramer.

2
00:00:04,252 --> 00:00:06,792
- Do you sleep in tents?
- No.

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:14,015
(Howard:)I slept in a hole I dug in the ground
with my bare hands.

4
00:00:14,763 --> 00:00:20,313
(Howard:)And at some point during the night,
an armadillo crawled in...

5
00:00:21,478 --> 00:00:23,728
(Howard:)...and spooned me.

6
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:29,280
- Poor baby.
- But I did it. I survived.

7
00:00:29,486 --> 00:00:33,946
l wasn't sure
I was going to when the sandstorm hit.

8
00:00:35,116 --> 00:00:40,826
l just pulled my turtleneck up
over my head and waited for death.

9
00:00:42,499 --> 00:00:45,459
(Howard:)But somehow as I sat there...

10
00:00:45,668 --> 00:00:49,758
(Howard:)...wrapped in a cocoon
of my own neck-sweat...

11
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:54,050
...l found that primal part
of the human spirit...

12
00:00:54,260 --> 00:01:01,020
(Howard:)...that just wants to keep on living,
heh-heh, no matter what the cost.

